  "SNS・note（note・本文）": [
   {
    "quote": "Street Fighter 6 Play Log 2024-04-13｜Morix",
    "url": "https://note.com/morix1500/n/n55b6078b3413?hl=en",
    "pass": 3
   },
   {
    "quote": "Street Fighter 6 Play Log 2024-04-13",
    "url": "https://note.com/morix1500/n/n55b6078b3413?hl=en",
    "pass": 3
   },
   {
    "quote": "I created a practice menu for Ken and worked through it. I'll be updating it as needed.",
    "url": "https://note.com/morix1500/n/n55b6078b3413?hl=en",
    "pass": 3
   },
   {
    "quote": "There are a lot of combos I need to memorize and hit confirming is also necessary, so it's tough...!",
    "url": "https://note.com/morix1500/n/n55b6078b3413?hl=en",
    "pass": 3
   },
   {
    "quote": "I've gotten much better at hit confirming! I'm not sure if I can pull it off properly in a real match, though.",
    "url": "https://note.com/morix1500/n/n55b6078b3413?hl=en",
    "pass": 3
   },
   {
    "quote": "Also, since I'm not good at playing against Ken, I thought about how to counter Tatsumaki Senpukyaku, which I've always struggled with.",
    "url": "https://note.com/morix1500/n/n55b6078b3413?hl=en",
    "pass": 3
   },
   {
    "quote": "For Modern Ken, there's only the Heavy version of Tatsumaki, so it seems like Drive Impact is a guaranteed punish. I can also knock it out of the air with Shoryuken. I forgot to look up Classic Ken, so I'll check that tomorrow.",
    "url": "https://note.com/morix1500/n/n55b6078b3413?hl=en",
    "pass": 3
   },
   {
    "quote": "SF6 Play Log 2024-03-24｜Morix",
    "url": "https://note.com/morix1500/n/nece8df031efd?hl=en",
    "pass": 3
   },
   {
    "quote": "SF6 Play Log 2024-03-24",
    "url": "https://note.com/morix1500/n/nece8df031efd?hl=en",
    "pass": 3
   },
   {
    "quote": "Continuing to practice Classic Marisa and the leverless controller.",
    "url": "https://note.com/morix1500/n/nece8df031efd?hl=en",
    "pass": 3
   },
   {
    "quote": "After practicing Dimachaerus-based setplay and jump attack combos, I went to Arcade Mode on Hardest difficulty.",
    "url": "https://note.com/morix1500/n/nece8df031efd?hl=en",
    "pass": 3
   },
   {
    "quote": "Actually, I had never cleared Hardest all the way to the end before, but today I defeated everyone for the first time!",
    "url": "https://note.com/morix1500/n/nece8df031efd?hl=en",
    "pass": 3
   },
   {
    "quote": "Maybe it's because I decided yesterday to list my tasks and focus on tackling them one by one.",
    "url": "https://note.com/morix1500/n/nece8df031efd?hl=en",
    "pass": 3
   },
   {
    "quote": "Next, I went to the Battle Hub. I think I managed to get my win rate close to 50%.",
    "url": "https://note.com/morix1500/n/nece8df031efd?hl=en",
    "pass": 3
   },
   {
    "quote": "My command accuracy is better than yesterday, and I can feel myself improving...!!",
    "url": "https://note.com/morix1500/n/nece8df031efd?hl=en",
    "pass": 3
   },
   {
    "quote": "スト6プレイ記 2024-03-16｜Morix",
    "url": "https://note.com/morix1500/n/n6349a3321a75",
    "pass": 3
   },
   {
    "quote": "まずは中タゲコンからディマカイルスに繋げられなかったこと。",
    "url": "https://note.com/morix1500/n/n6349a3321a75",
    "pass": 3
   },
   {
    "quote": "この練習はダミーのガードをランダムにし、中タゲコンをしてガードされたらグラディウス、ヒットしてたらディマカイルスを出す練習をした。慣れてきたらディマカイルスをod版に変えてみる練習。",
    "url": "https://note.com/morix1500/n/n6349a3321a75",
    "pass": 3
   },
   {
    "quote": "モダンだとワンボタンで必殺技が出せるのでヒット確認から技を出すまでの猶予が結構あるけどクラシックはコマンド入力が必要なので猶予があまりなく難しい。",
    "url": "https://note.com/morix1500/n/n6349a3321a75",
    "pass": 3
   },
   {
    "quote": "あとガード時は通常グラディウス、ヒット時はodディマカイルスは押すボタンが異なるのでさらに難しかった。",
    "url": "https://note.com/morix1500/n/n6349a3321a75",
    "pass": 3
   },
   {
    "quote": "モダンのときはodディマカイルスで対空していた。クラシックだとかなり難しい。対空待ちしてる間、竜巻コマンドを作っておけばいいのだけど、ディマカイルスの派生を出すタイミングでSA2が高確率で出てしかも外れてしまう。これを安定して派生出すのが無理だったので諦めた。",
    "url": "https://note.com/morix1500/n/n6349a3321a75",
    "pass": 3
   },
   {
    "quote": "じゃあ弱グラディウスで対空しようと思ったのだがこれも即反応しないと難しい。",
    "url": "https://note.com/morix1500/n/n6349a3321a75",
    "pass": 3
   },
   {
    "quote": "ということで2強Pで対空することに決めた。これはこれで難しいけどいまのところ1番安定するのがこれなので頑張るしかない！",
    "url": "https://note.com/morix1500/n/n6349a3321a75",
    "pass": 3
   },
   {
    "quote": "スト6プレイ記 2024-05-04｜Morix",
    "url": "https://note.com/morix1500/n/n0dd5be01ba4a",
    "pass": 3
   },
   {
    "quote": "以前からマノン興味あって昨日ちょっと触って面白そうだったので今日はマノンを本格的に触ってみることにした。キャラ変すぐしがちだけど、キャラ知識がつくので問題ないと思ってる。",
    "url": "https://note.com/morix1500/n/n0dd5be01ba4a",
    "pass": 3
   },
   {
    "quote": "コマンド表見る限り苦手な昇龍拳コマンドがないので行けそうだなと思ってクラシックにすることに。",
    "url": "https://note.com/morix1500/n/n0dd5be01ba4a",
    "pass": 3
   },
   {
    "quote": "マノン講座の動画やブログを読んで基本的なコンボや立ち回りを学習。",
    "url": "https://note.com/morix1500/n/n0dd5be01ba4a",
    "pass": 3
   },
   {
    "quote": "コンボチュートリアルをやってひたすらコンボ練習！",
    "url": "https://note.com/morix1500/n/n0dd5be01ba4a",
    "pass": 3
   },
   {
    "quote": "基本的なコンボが少なくて覚えるのが苦手な自分には良さそう。",
    "url": "https://note.com/morix1500/n/n0dd5be01ba4a",
    "pass": 3
   },
   {
    "quote": "中P→ラッシュ→2中P→4強P→中ランヴェルセのコンボを使ってヒット確認の練習をした。",
    "url": "https://note.com/morix1500/n/n0dd5be01ba4a",
    "pass": 3
   },
   {
    "quote": "あとはダミーにインパクト・ラッシュ攻撃・ジャンプ攻撃・波動拳を仕込んでそれぞれ対応する練習。",
    "url": "https://note.com/morix1500/n/n0dd5be01ba4a",
    "pass": 3
   }
  ],
